    (English: 'This "Portable Network Graphics" image is encoded with an unknown compression scheme which could not be decoded.'; Localized: '此「Portable Network Graphics」影像使用無法解碼的未知壓縮配置進行編碼。'),
    (English: 'This "Portable Network Graphics" image uses an unknown interlace scheme which could not be decoded.'; Localized: '此「Portable Network Graphics」影像使用無法解碼的未知交錯配置。'),
