    (English: 'The chunks must be compatible to be assigned.'; Localized: '區塊必須相容才能指派。'),
    (English: 'This "Portable Network Graphics" image is invalid because the decoder found an unexpected end of the file.'; Localized: '此「Portable Network Graphics」影像無效，因為解碼器發現未預期的檔案結尾。'),
